# Build context is the repository root: docker build -f tools/federation-api/Dockerfile .
# Allowlist: ignore everything, then re-include only what the image needs.
*
!tools/federation-api/pyproject.toml
!tools/federation-api/uv.lock
!tools/federation-api/app
tools/federation-api/app/**/__pycache__
